        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-5 text-heading">
          What Is Google Business Profile Optimization?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-body mb-6">
          Your Google Business Profile (GBP) is the single most important tool for ranking in the Google Map Pack and
          driving calls from local customers. We fully optimize, manage, and defend your GBP—so you stay visible, get
          more reviews, and never lose out to spam or competitors.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center mb-2">
          <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-bluelight font-heading font-semibold">Maps SEO</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-bluelight font-heading font-semibold">GBP Management</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-bluelight font-heading font-semibold">Review Generation</span>
