            <p class="mb-4 text-body">
              We claim or create your listing, verify ownership, and lock down your business details so no one can
              hijack your profile.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Feature 2 -->
          <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-8 flex flex-col group">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#f56b2a]">Full Profile Optimization</h3>
            <p class="mb-4 text-body">
              We optimize every field—services, categories, photos, Q&A, hours, and more—to maximize ranking and
              relevance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Feature 3 -->
          <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-8 flex flex-col group">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#f56b2a]">Map Pack Ranking & Maps SEO</h3>
            <p class="mb-4 text-body">
