            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#f56b2a]">Ongoing Posts, Photos & Updates</h3>
            <p class="mb-4 text-body">
              We keep your profile fresh and active with regular posts, photo uploads, and service updates—Google loves
              activity.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Feature 6 -->
